Dina &lt;a href="Organisation%20for%20Economic%20Co-operation%20and%20Development"&gt;Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development&lt;/a&gt; publication service &lt;a href="OECD%20iLibrary"&gt;OECD iLibrary&lt;/a&gt;, unggal tabél atawa grafik dina hiji OECD publikasi dipintonkeun ku hiji nami DOI anu nuju ka file Excel data dina dasar tabél jeung grafik. Pangwangunan salajengna jasa sapertos direncanakeun.
